<div class="error-page">
    <div class="oa-container">
        <a href="/" class="logo"><img
            src="data:image/png;base64,"
            alt="OANDA Logo"></a>

        <h1>Sorry, there's a problem on our side</h1>
        <h4>We are aware of this problem and are working to fix it.</h4>

        <p><strong>In the meantime, here is what you can do:</strong></p>

        <ul>
            <li><i class="material-icons">autorenew</i> Refresh the page (sometimes this helps)</li>
            <li><i class="material-icons">access_time</i> Try again in 30 minutes</li>
            <li><i class="material-icons">help</i> Visit our <a href="https://help.oanda.com" target="_blank"
                                                                rel="noopener">support site</a> and tell us what
                happened
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h3>You can still use the following services</h3>

        <div class="content-cards content-cards--equal-height content-cards--align-top">
            <div class="content-cards__card">
                <div
                    class="content-cards__card__inner background--white content-cards__card--align-left  content-cards__card--rounded">
                    <div class="content-cards__card__content">
                        <div class="content-cards__card__content-block content-cards__card__content-block--icon">
                            <div class="icon icon--left">
                                <img
                                    src="data:image/png;base64,"
                                    width="60" height="60" alt="Existing client image">
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="content-cards__card__content-block content-cards__card__content-block--title">
                            <h3>Existing client?</h3>
                        </div>

                        <div class="content-cards__card__content-block content-cards__card__content-block--text">
                            <div class="rich-text"><p>Log in to the portal to deposit or withdraw funds to/from your
                                OANDA account.</p></div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="content-cards__card__content-block content-cards__card__content-block--ctas">
                            <div class="button-group">
                                <a href="https://www.oanda.com/account/login" class="btn btn--primary btn--blue"
                                   target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sign in</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cf">
            <h5><div class="cf-error-details cf-error-502">
  <h1>Bad gateway</h1>
  <p>The web server reported a bad gateway error.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Ray ID: 9d67cc318abd377c</li>
    <li>Your IP address: 187.124.3.145</li>
    <li>Error reference number: 502</li>
    <li>Cloudflare Location: Frankfurt</li>
  </ul>
</div>
</h5>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
